{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達公司用了數十年時間成長為全球最具影響力的科技公司之一，但其董事會卻未能跟上步伐。如今，公司治理和高管招聘專家表示，這個由10名董事組成的董事會此前疏於規劃行政總裁黃仁勳的繼任安排，如今也缺乏妥善處理這一問題的準備。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586268.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T13:01:40.422843+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T12:51:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T12:55:00.034069+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T12:55:00.034069+00:00","content_hash":"4f5f3f0450e993c9fd963bff8d9076412d35c7a55d7e6a6fc92711bdebd4a20f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}